Package: ClimateTweetStats
Title: What the Package Does (One Line, Title Case)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: Christie Pierre-Louis
    person("christie", "Pierre-Louis", , "cpierrelouis310@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: package that processes and visualizes climate-related sentiments
  from Twitter post. This includes temperature anomaly,
  sentiment trends and comparisons, and emotional location insight. 
  Useful for exploring how public sentiment shifts in response to environmental extremes.
